"It looks like you're using the old SendGrid config vars on Heroku, "
"<code>SENDGRID_USERNAME</code> and <code>SENDGRID_PASSWORD</code>. These are "
"now deprecated (as of version 2.6), and will stop working in a future "
"version of Tabbycat. Please change your config vars to use "
"<code>SENDGRID_API_KEY</code> instead. For more information, please see <a "
"href=\"https://tabbycat.readthedocs.io/en/stable/features/"
"notifications.html#configuring-an-email-provider\"> our documentation on "
"this topic</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vyzerá to, že na Heroku používaš staré konfiguračné premenné SendGridu, "
"<code>SENDGRID_USERNAME</code> a <code>SENDGRID_PASSWORD</code>. Od verzie "
"2.6 sú zastarané a v budúcej verzii Tabbycatu prestanú fungovať. Zmeň "
"konfiguráciu tak, aby používala <code>SENDGRID_API_KEY</code>. Viac "
"informácií nájdeš v <a href=\"https://tabbycat.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"
"features/notifications.html#configuring-an-email-provider\">našej "
"dokumentácii k tejto téme</a>."

